<title>UK: DDB's Zone Bleue wins Mobil Morrocan ad account.</title>
<headline>DDB's Zone Bleue wins Mobil Morrocan ad account.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zone Bleue, the Moroccan affiliate of advertising agency DDB, on Friday said it has won the Mobil Corp account in Morocco.</p>
<p>DDB, part of Omnicom Group Inc, announced the account award in a statement released in London.</p>
<p>DDB already services Mobile in more than 40 coutnries. Zone Bleue said it won the Moroccan account after a competition against two other agencies, including the incumbent.</p>
<p>-- London Advertising Newsdesk +44 171 542 2815</p>
</text>
